                                                "sense_id": "1434e986-bdc4-3174-b584-a1a1200bee9d",
                                                "text": "More than 3,000 people have been arrested since Jan. 9. The police have even released images of some detainees stripped down to their underwear, recalling images from Mr. Bukele's infamous megaprisons."
